<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
    <title>Pidro data deletion</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; background: #f3eee4; color: #1c2a3a; font: 18px/1.6 Nunito, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; }
      main { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 12px 40px; }
      .logo { display: block; width: 200px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto 18px; }
      .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e6ddc9; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px 28px; }
      h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.25; }
      p { margin: 0 0 20px; }
      .sv { margin-top: 4px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #efe7d6; }
      code { font-size: 16px; }
      footer { padding: 26px 16px 0; text-align: center; color: #7a5a36; font-size: 14px; }
      footer a { color: #7a5a36; }
      @media (max-width: 480px) { .card { padding: 26px 20px; } h1 { font-size: 23px; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main data-state={if @deletion, do: "processed", else: "unknown"}>
      <img class="logo" src={~p"/images/logo-email.png"} width="200" height="124" alt="Pidro" />
      <div class="card">
        <%= if @deletion do %>
          <h1>Your data-deletion request is done</h1>
          <p>
            We received your request on {Date.to_iso8601(@deletion.inserted_at)} and processed it.
            Any Pidro account linked to this Facebook login is deleted.
          </p>
          <p>Confirmation code: <code>{@deletion.code}</code></p>
          <div class="sv" lang="sv">
            <h1>Din begäran om radering är klar</h1>
            <p>
              Vi tog emot din begäran den {Date.to_iso8601(@deletion.inserted_at)} och har behandlat den.
              Om ett Pidro-konto var kopplat till den här Facebook-inloggningen är det raderat.
            </p>
            <p>Bekräftelsekod: <code>{@deletion.code}</code></p>
          </div>
        <% else %>
          <h1>We don't know this confirmation code</h1>
          <p>Check the code Facebook showed you, or write to {@support_email}.</p>
          <div class="sv" lang="sv">
            <h1>Vi känner inte igen den här bekräftelsekoden</h1>
            <p>Kontrollera koden som Facebook visade dig, eller skriv till {@support_email}.</p>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <footer>
        Pidro, the card game from Ostrobothnia<br /> Questions? Write to
        <a href={"mailto:#{@support_email}"}>{@support_email}</a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
